{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And you shall not flatter the land.</b> In its plain sense, a term of flattery: do not flatter the murderers, the inhabitants of the land, to exempt them from the judgment they deserve, for <b>it is the blood that flatters</b> etc. Therefore I warn you about this, for the murderers, who are men of blood — their way is to flatter the inhabitants of the land so that they will show favor to them." "<b>And the land shall not have atonement.</b> And the inhabitants of the land shall not have atonement."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:47.554983247Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}